From efba8d1b561d48fe1ae15aa3ccff8d52efef8f8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:49:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Host AI in a headless sidecar client and add sidecar
 replay debug modes

Adds -autostart-ai-host: a headless client that joins over the network,
computes AI for the slots the server strips from every stock client, and
sends its moves as ordinary network commands. The per-player AI flag stays
false everywhere so command processing is identical on every client.

Also adds -sidecar-replay and -replay-ai-host for OOS hunting, the
hashbreakdown debug log, and CLI.md documenting the command line.
